# 2. Final Architecture Documentation

# Banking Management System Architecture

## Architecture

The project follows a layered full-stack architecture.

React Frontend
      |
      | HTTP/REST
      |
Spring Boot REST Controllers
      |
      ▼
Service Layer
      |
      ▼
Repository Layer
      |
      ▼
MySQL Database

# Security Architecture
React Login
     |
     ▼
Authentication API
     |
     ▼
Spring Security
     |
     ▼
JWT Generation
     |
     ▼
JWT stored by frontend
     |
     ▼
Protected API request
     |
     ▼
JWT Authentication Filter
     |
     ▼
Role Authorization
     |
     ▼
Controller


USER:

USER
 ├── Dashboard
 ├── Accounts
 ├── Deposit
 ├── Withdraw
 └── Transactions

ADMIN:

ADMIN
 ├── Admin Dashboard
 ├── Users
 ├── Accounts
 ├── Transactions
 ├── Activate
 └── Deactivate


 
