# 3. Final Testing Checklist

# Banking Management System Testing

## Authentication

| Test | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Valid Login | Dashboard opens | PASS |
| Invalid Password | Login rejected | PASS |
| Invalid Email | Login rejected | PASS |
| Logout | Redirects to Login | PASS |

## User

| Test | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Create Account | Account created | PASS |
| View Accounts | Accounts displayed | PASS |
| Deposit | Balance increases | PASS |
| Withdraw | Balance decreases | PASS |
| Transactions | Transaction displayed | PASS |

## Admin

| Test | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Admin Login | Admin Dashboard | PASS |
| View Users | Users displayed | PASS |
| Search User | Matching users displayed | PASS |
| Activate | Account activated | PASS |
| Deactivate | Account deactivated | PASS |
| View Accounts | Accounts displayed | PASS |
| View Transactions | Transactions displayed | PASS |

## Security

| Test | Expected Result | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Access Dashboard without JWT | Redirect/reject | PASS |
| USER accesses ADMIN API | Reject | PASS |
| Invalid JWT | Reject | PASS |
| Logout token cleanup | Token removed | PASS |